  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chatham House the New Producers Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;New Producers Group&#x2019; is a s collaborative network of over 30 development countries. The aim is to achieve positive and lasting development in emerging oil and gas producer countries. The Group helps them manage their petroleum resources effectively and think beyond oil and gas and facilitates participant-led working groups on key issues, hosts the Annual Meeting, runs a neutral helpdesk function, training sessions, technical exchanges and tools, and produces disseminated research.</narrative>
  </description>
